\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Who\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"asks about a person\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Ticket Agent</span>: Who packed your bags? </span><br/><span class=\\\"italic\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Vanessa</span>: I packed my bags. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"What\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"asks for information\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Vanessa</span>: What gate is it? </span><br/><span class=\\\"italic\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Ticket Agent</span>: The flight leaves from Gate 7A.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"When\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"asks for time\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Vanessa</span>:  When does the flight leave? </span><br/><span class=\\\"italic\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Ticket Agent</span>: 3:45 P.M.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Where\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"asks about a place\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Vanessa</span>: Where is the ticket counter? </span><br/><span class=\\\"italic\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Clerk</span>: It's around the corner. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Why\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"asks for a reason\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Vanessa</span>:  Why do I have to pay extra for my luggage? </span><br/><span class=\\\"italic\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Ticket Agent</span>: It is over the weight limit. </span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Imagine you are checking in at the airport.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The ticket agent asks you questions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Answer the questions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a 6-8 line dialogue.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Practice with your partner.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I use expressions for checking in and write a dialogue.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I ask questions using words like <span class=\"italic\">when</span>, <span class=\"italic\">where</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I respond to questions in an airport.", "type": "text"}]}], "labs": [{"id": 0, "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "1", "image": "engenn3le09ob01re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Ticket Agent</span>:         Good afternoon. Are you here to check in? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:         Yes. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ticket Agent</span>:          Where are you traveling to today?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:         Mexico! <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ticket Agent</span>:         Is that your final destination?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:         Yes, it is.<br>", "id": 1, "time": "7000", "image": "engenn3le09ob01re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Ticket Agent</span>:         Very good, Ma'am. Could I see your passport and ticket, please?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:         Yes, of course. I have an e-ticket.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ticket Agent</span>:         Perfect. Would you like a window seat or aisle seat?<br>\n<span class=\